# Pick an egg up from the configured egg_grasp_pose and set it down at the
# configured egg_place_pose — both FIXED config values, no perception, no
# arguments. Egg-safe gripping requires a LOW gripper_force in jaka_arm's
# config (applied once at connect; the skill cannot change it per call).
#
# Request has no fields — the tool takes no arguments ({}).
---
# Whether the flow completed (every waypoint converged; non-fatal lift
# failures are reported in `message`).
bool success

# Human-readable status. On failure, names the failing stage (preflight /
# grasp/open / approach / descend / grasp/close / lift / egg/approach /
# egg/descend / egg/open / egg/lift).
string message

# How long the whole call took (s).
float32 elapsed_s
